  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T05:10:48.419580Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T05:10:48.420585Z",
  "totalBlocks": 29,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "844798d3b0ba88ed",
      "translationZh": "几周前，我们很高兴地宣布 Habana Labs 与 Hugging Face 将合作加速 Transformer 模型训练。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2f8bdf25af10576",
      "translationZh": "与最新的基于 GPU 的 Amazon EC2 实例相比，Habana Gaudi 加速器为机器学习模型训练带来最高 40% 的价格性能优势。我们非常兴奋能把这一价格性能优势带给 Transformers 🚀",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85937f564bc34e38",
      "translationZh": "在这篇实操文章中，我将向你展示如何在 Amazon Web Services 上快速搭建 Habana Gaudi 实例，然后微调一个用于文本分类的 BERT 模型。照例，所有代码都会提供，方便你在自己的项目中复用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9aad22f274a733b1",
      "translationZh": "开始吧！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fb5ec5628f0139b4",
      "translationZh": "在 AWS 上搭建 Habana Gaudi 实例",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2c19ea653a100aa",
      "translationZh": "使用 Habana Gaudi 加速器最简单的方式是启动一台 Amazon EC2 DL1 实例。这些实例配备 8 个 Habana Gaudi 处理器，借助 Habana 深度学习 Amazon Machine Image（AMI）可以轻松投入使用。该 AMI 预装了 Habana SynapseAI® SDK 以及运行 Gaudi 加速 Docker 容器所需的工具。如果你想用其他 AMI 或容器，Habana 文档里有说明。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "658db64a63f16915",
      "translationZh": "从 us-east-1 区域的 EC2 控制台开始，我先点击 Launch an instance，并为实例命名（\"habana-demo-julsimon\"）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16b8f5e904257a87",
      "translationZh": "然后，我在 Amazon Marketplace 搜索 Habana AMI。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a28ba63eda63c487",
      "translationZh": "我选择 Habana Deep Learning Base AMI (Ubuntu 20.04)。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d1984147e433cfa",
      "translationZh": "接着选择 dl1.24xlarge 实例规格（唯一可用的规格）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5825ee3d357cb4a2",
      "translationZh": "然后选择我将用来 ssh 连接实例的密钥对。没有的话可以现场创建。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20f1c83630b141bc",
      "translationZh": "下一步，确保实例允许入站 ssh 流量。为简单起见我没有限制来源地址，但在你自己的账户里一定要限制。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "459e0e0cb2b53a13",
      "translationZh": "默认情况下，该 AMI 启动的实例只有 8GB Amazon EBS 存储，这里不够用。我把存储加到 50GB。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4431e953e885922b",
      "translationZh": "接下来，为实例分配一个 Amazon IAM 角色。真实场景中，该角色应具备运行训练任务所需的最小权限集，例如从你的某个 Amazon S3 存储桶读取数据的能力。本例不需要这个角色，因为数据集将从 Hugging Face hub 下载。如果你不熟悉 IAM，强烈建议阅读 Getting Started 文档。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1f54be8b4c80946",
      "translationZh": "然后，我让 EC2 把实例配置为 Spot Instance——这是把每小时 13.11 美元的成本降下来的好办法。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74790d851d82d170",
      "translationZh": "最后启动实例。几分钟后实例就绪，我可以用 ssh 连接。Windows 用户可以按文档用 PuTTY 完成同样操作。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15a94d8724203ef4",
      "translationZh": "在这个实例上，最后一个准备步骤是拉取 Habana 的 PyTorch 容器——我将用它来微调模型。其他预构建容器以及如何构建自己的容器，见 Habana 文档。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c256f7bc26ea4ee0",
      "translationZh": "镜像拉到实例上后，我以交互模式运行它。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2aa26371d9dc6a41",
      "translationZh": "现在可以微调模型了。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a31a420a9740642c",
      "translationZh": "在 Habana Gaudi 上微调文本分类模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ac52cfa680c222b",
      "translationZh": "我先在刚启动的容器里克隆 Optimum Habana 仓库。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13bf83ea7b350894",
      "translationZh": "然后从源码安装 Optimum Habana 包。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4124dc2bc4fe146",
      "translationZh": "接着进入包含文本分类示例的子目录，安装所需的 Python 包。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66132070c2dd290e",
      "translationZh": "现在可以启动训练任务了：它会从 Hugging Face hub 下载 bert-large-uncased-whole-word-masking 模型，并在 GLUE 基准的 MRPC 任务上微调。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c32c1d8dbd696e6",
      "translationZh": "请注意，我从 Hugging Face hub 获取 BERT 的 Habana Gaudi 配置，你也可以用自己的一份。此外，其他流行模型同样受支持，它们的配置文件可在 Habana 组织下找到。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19a40f77e78e1483",
      "translationZh": "2 分 12 秒后任务完成，取得了 0.9181 的优秀 F1 分数——多训练几个 epoch 肯定还能提高。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e438f68c362141de",
      "translationZh": "最后同样重要的是，我终止 EC2 实例以免产生不必要的费用。看 EC2 控制台的 Savings Summary，得益于 Spot Instance 我省了 70%，每小时只付 3.93 美元而不是 13.11 美元。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a248a47e5f1f603d",
      "translationZh": "如你所见，Transformers、Habana Gaudi 与 AWS 实例的组合强大、简单又划算。试试看并告诉我们你的想法。我们非常欢迎你在 Hugging Face Forum 上提问和反馈。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "624609b5a27edf27",
      "translationZh": "如需了解在 Gaudi 处理器上训练 Hugging Face 模型的更多信息，请联系 Habana。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
